  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Mongameli Mabona (2021), published by Leuven University Press, has been cited 2 times. Beyond that, it has been downloaded 1,562 times.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Mongameli Mabona by Ernst Wolff was published by Leuven University Press in 2021. It is part of the ISBN:978-94-6270-255-4 series. Conceptually, the work connects to Work (physics), Engineering and Mechanical engineering.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records 2 citations. Notable citing venues include African Journal of Inter/Multidisciplinary Studies. The citing authors are based in South Africa.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It has been downloaded 1,562 times via OAPEN. It is recorded in 2 library collections. Its subject matter aligns with Gender equality among the Sustainable Development Goals. The work was funded by KU Leuven.</p>",
